== claude-code.mcp.json (json)
mcpServers.unifi-fabric.env:
  - UNIFI_DRY_RUN
  - UNIFI_ENABLE_CONNECTOR_WRITE
  - UNIFI_DISABLED_TOOL_FAMILIES
  - UNIFI_DISABLE_API_SOURCES
  + UNIFI_WRITE_POLICY=dry-run
  + UNIFI_EXCLUDE=family:vpn,family:hotspot,source:network/private.classic,source:protect/private
Dry run: nothing written. Run again with --write to save (keeps a .bak copy).
